(text "E3-02 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §2.6; §5.2; §8.1 (шлях димінгу)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 270.51 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8e6659f9-f7de-5868-99fe-8686615b38b6))
(text "Brightness control requires confirmed DDC/CI support or an exact Wisecoco KEY/Backlight interface. Pico GP17\nis now reserved for MCP watchdog reset and unavailable for brightness.\nВорота (стенд): Demonstrate ddcutil brightness through the specified RA620 link, or obtain the exact\nKEY/Backlight revision pinout and design a new interface using a free MCP GPIO if suitable. Verify thermal\ndimming; do not reuse Pico GP17." (at 270.51 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a34df0fe-cf05-55f5-bfac-fda71e219044))
(rectangle (start 269.24 53.34) (end 406.4 81.28) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid f9713cea-bd7f-5ab3-a3ce-1c4c1e4911c1))
(text "E3-07 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1; §5.2; §8 (Pico ADC)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 270.51 54.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b4140d0d-175e-5efd-8fb0-e6a7dde4add8))
(text "Battery ADC shutdown accuracy must be calibrated. Divider/reference initial tolerances can contribute about\n+/-0.28 V near 13.05 V; a nominal ADC code does not establish the 13.05 +/-0.1 V cutoff. The software window\n12.95-13.15 V must stay above the E1-04 hardware AON UV trip window 12.8 +/-0.1 V on every unit.\nВорота (стенд): Calibrate gain/offset against a calibrated voltmeter at two pack-equivalent voltages such as\n12.6 V and 16.4 V; cross-check INA228. Independently verify the physical 13.05 V software cutoff (labd and\nPico fallback both 13050 mV) within +/-0.1 V, including 5 s dwell, at 12.95/13.05/13.15 V across the specified\ntemperature and load states. Per unit, at maximum and minimum load: the measured software cutoff referred to\nE1_N minus the measured E1-04 hardware trip must be >=0.10 V, and during a controlled discharge the graceful\nshutdown (5 s dwell plus Linux shutdown) must complete before the hardware UV trip asserts OFF; otherwise\nre-trim or reject. Store calibrated coefficients with revision/CRC. No commissioning pass until met; the\nhardware AON UV supervisor remains an independent backup." (at 270.51 56.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 04871dba-b8c9-5a94-b514-7edd4b46d8ff))
