(text "E3-04 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.2 (UART7, PPS, SWD); §8.1 (UART7; PPS)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 189.23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid df00dc71-f19f-52b3-a809-8e2e57e8ae6e))
(text "UM3304 UART7/PPS/SWD cable capacitance and power-off behavior cannot be proven by ERC.\nВорота (стенд): Check <=20cm wiring, UART7 loopback, boot glitches and absence of Q6A backfeed with Pico\non/Q6A off. Verify TX high-impedance sequencing or add hardware isolation." (at 13.97 191.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 099b7beb-60f2-575d-9299-f74012f9a855))
